# Humanities Teaching and Research at the University of California, San Francisco.

**Authors:** Jameton, Andrew, Todes, Dan

## Abstract
Among the humanities offerings integrated into the health sciences at the University of California, San Francisco, are the following: bioethics workshop, ethical dilemmas in medical practice, health and human rights, and history of the health sciences. Such courses help illuminate the relationship between humanities teaching and the health professional curriculum. (SK)

